WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.580 --> 00:00:07.009
When we talk about politics, there's inside
baseball, there's inside baseball topics that

00:00:07.009 --> 00:00:12.420
only political pundits would be aware of and
then you've got like your bonafide serious

00:00:12.420 --> 00:00:17.230
crises that affect everyone. Whether you pay
attention to politics or not. One of these

00:00:17.230 --> 00:00:24.300
serious issues that impacts every single American
is the collapsing confidence in the American

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:28.810
president around the world. And it's important
to understand that agreeing with the president

00:00:28.810 --> 00:00:34.990
on every issue is very different than simply
having the confidence that the president is

00:00:34.990 --> 00:00:37.830
going to adhere to some basic minimum norms.

00:00:37.830 --> 00:00:42.990
So for example, I disagreed with Barack Obama
on some political issues. I disagreed about

00:00:42.990 --> 00:00:49.560
drone policy. I disagreed about his approach
to the genesis of what ultimately became Obamacare,

00:00:49.560 --> 00:00:54.260
right? I disagreed with Barack Obama and on
different policy issues, but at no point did

00:00:54.260 --> 00:00:59.820
I worry that Barack Obama's behavior and norm
breaking would cause a crisis of confidence

00:00:59.820 --> 00:01:06.010
around the world in the u s presidency as
an institution in our country. That's what's

00:01:06.010 --> 00:01:11.000
taking place right with Donald Trump. And
He seems to be trying to convince people of

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:15.330
the opposite. And I have the numbers to show
you. So with Donald Trump, very often the

00:01:15.330 --> 00:01:20.740
truth is the opposite of what he says. And
in fact, this is a phenomenon known as projection.

00:01:20.740 --> 00:01:26.280
Trump is projecting onto others the truth
about himself and his administration. So here's

00:01:26.280 --> 00:01:33.280
an example. Lately Donald Trump has been insisting
that the Democrats are a laughing stock and

00:01:33.280 --> 00:01:39.250
that the world is laughing at the u s because
of the Democrats. Here's an example clip of

00:01:39.250 --> 00:01:41.060
Donald Trump saying this,

00:01:41.060 --> 00:01:47.970
these people at clowns, the Democrats at clowns,
they're being left at all over the world.

00:01:47.970 --> 00:01:52.979
And I watched this morning, I watched Dancy
Pelosi trying to get through that with the

00:01:52.979 --> 00:01:58.790
performance that Robert Muller put on, where
I don't think he ever read the agreement or

00:01:58.790 --> 00:02:04.441
the document and the document said no collusion.
They don't even talk about that. So there

00:02:04.441 --> 00:02:05.441
was no crime.

00:02:05.441 --> 00:02:10.350
The truth just happens to be the opposite.
And we have the numbers and the numbers are

00:02:10.350 --> 00:02:17.970
really bad. Pew Research Center Study Data
is from 20 a 2001 to 2018 there is a lot of

00:02:17.970 --> 00:02:22.630
data on the screen, but what you will see
is that confidence in the United States president

00:02:22.630 --> 00:02:28.610
to do the right thing regarding foreign affairs
has plummeted under Donald Trump in almost

00:02:28.610 --> 00:02:35.600
every country with the exception of Russia,
Russia compared to Barack Obama and George

00:02:35.600 --> 00:02:42.620
W. Bush, Russia is the country that has increased
their confidence that the United States president

00:02:42.620 --> 00:02:47.100
will do the right thing internationally under
Donald Trump. Every other country on this

00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:52.410
list is experiencing a crisis of confidence
in the American presidency. Canada is minus

00:02:52.410 --> 00:03:01.570
61 France is minus 70 Germany and the Netherlands
are minus 75 Sweden is minus 83 in their confidence

00:03:01.570 --> 00:03:06.700
that the American president will do the right
thing. Japan minus 54 you can see the way

00:03:06.700 --> 00:03:07.700
that this is going.

00:03:07.700 --> 00:03:12.750
I don't have to read every single one for
you, and again, Russia, the one country on

00:03:12.750 --> 00:03:18.970
the list that has more confidence in the American
presidency when Donald Trump is the president,

00:03:18.970 --> 00:03:24.830
so this actually matters whether you're into
politics or not. This is a metric that relates

00:03:24.830 --> 00:03:30.580
to everything from economics to culture to
simply maybe being an American that might

00:03:30.580 --> 00:03:35.180
travel to some of these countries. Russia
and confidence in the U s president is up

00:03:35.180 --> 00:03:41.069
under Trump. Everywhere else it is down and
anytime that Donald Trump tries to pull our

00:03:41.069 --> 00:03:46.959
attention somewhere, in this case it's the
world is laughing at Democrats, you should

00:03:46.959 --> 00:03:51.950
immediately be suspicious that the truth is
the opposite and in this case, it just so

00:03:51.950 --> 00:03:58.260
happens to be you only have to look to every
single recent meeting of world leaders to

00:03:58.260 --> 00:04:03.000
see them putting this into action. We have
a picture up on the screen now for our video

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:04.000
audience.

00:04:04.000 --> 00:04:09.810
I forget which meeting or summit this is from,
but increasingly Donald Trump is in a literal

00:04:09.810 --> 00:04:15.300
sense, not part of the conversation with world
leaders and in the more metaphorical sense,

00:04:15.300 --> 00:04:20.339
the United States has increasingly not a participant
in many of the conversations that the world

00:04:20.339 --> 00:04:26.860
is having about serious issues when it comes
to global alliances, when it comes to trade,

00:04:26.860 --> 00:04:32.380
when it comes to climate change, for sure.
Donald Trump personally and the United States

00:04:32.380 --> 00:04:36.939
as a country, it's just not even invited to
be part of the conversation and it is this

00:04:36.939 --> 00:04:41.860
crisis of confidence that is underlying it
and that is behind it. If you don't care how

00:04:41.860 --> 00:04:46.749
the u s does, then you don't need to worry
about this. If you live in the United States

00:04:46.749 --> 00:04:53.110
as roughly 70% of our audience does, you have
a vested interest in how the United States

00:04:53.110 --> 00:04:56.330
does. It affects you, it affects your family.

00:04:56.330 --> 00:05:01.229
It affects how we are seen around the world
and this is not good. If you're not worried

00:05:01.229 --> 00:05:06.080
about this, I want to hear from you, okay?
If you are an American who lives in the United

00:05:06.080 --> 00:05:10.800
States currently and you don't deny the numbers,
right? I mean if you just don't believe the

00:05:10.800 --> 00:05:15.460
numbers, okay, then you can bury your head
in the sand and people do that. If you believe

00:05:15.460 --> 00:05:20.249
the numbers and you live in the United States
and you're not worried about the crisis of

00:05:20.249 --> 00:05:24.740
confidence that the presidency is suffering
under Donald Trump, I want to hear from you

00:05:24.740 --> 00:05:28.819
genuinely. I want to hear your explanation
as to why it's not something that worries

00:05:28.819 --> 00:05:28.830
you.

